WEBVTT

00:13:59.141 --> 00:14:00.887
flat on my back,

00:14:00.911 --> 00:14:04.927
twelve weeks, six months
and three whole years

00:14:04.951 --> 00:14:08.266
after I fell out that window
and became paralyzed,

00:14:08.290 --> 00:14:12.045
the scientists turned the stimulator on

00:14:12.069 --> 00:14:15.990
and I pulled my knee to my chest.

00:14:16.704 --> 00:14:19.990
(Video) Man: OK, start,
go, go, go, go, go.

00:14:20.014 --> 00:14:21.164
Good, good, good.

00:14:21.188 --> 00:14:25.164
SG: Yeah, yeah, go on, Mark,
go on, go, go, go, go, go, wow!

00:14:25.188 --> 00:14:26.339
(Applause)

00:14:26.363 --> 00:14:27.577
(Laughter)

00:14:28.339 --> 00:14:29.490
SG: Well done!

00:14:29.514 --> 00:14:32.333
(Applause)